@startuml get-consent-list
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo", "Noto Sans CJK KR", sans-serif
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam BoxPadding 8
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
hide footbox

title GET /api/v1/user/consent/list
caption CRB-12 · 최신 약관 목록과 내 동의 여부

actor Client
participant "AnyStatusGuard" as Guard
participant "ConsentController" as Controller
participant "ConsentService" as Service
participant "ConsentRepository" as ConsentRepository
database PostgreSQL

Client -> Guard: GET /api/v1/user/consent/list\nAuthorization: Bearer <access token>
ref over Client, Guard: authenticate() — flow/auth-guards.puml\n401 Missing access token / Token expired / Invalid token
note right of Guard: 가입 상태와 관계없이 통과 (pending · active)
Guard -> Controller: getList(user)
Controller -> Service: getList(userPk)
Service -> ConsentRepository: findLatestWithAgreement(userPk)
ConsentRepository -> PostgreSQL: SELECT consent (type별 최신 버전)\n+ 내 유효한 동의 여부 (revoked_at IS NULL)
note right: 최신 버전 · 유효한 동의 판정은\nconsent.sql.ts (가입 단계 가드와 같은 조각)
PostgreSQL --> ConsentRepository: rows (ORDER BY type)
ConsentRepository --> Service: LatestConsent[]
Service --> Controller: { consents }
Controller --> Client: 200 { consents: [{ type, version, is_required, url, agreed }] }

@enduml
